#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Bandwidth:</strong> Set the capacity used to calculate utilisation, for example 100M or 1G. K, M, G and T are supported. Select Same As &quot;In&quot; when both directions have equal capacity.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Traffic interface:</strong> Search by device, port or description, or select Browse all. Choose an interface, then click Use interface to set the primary measured source, click destination and main hover graph. Additional measured sources and hover graphs are kept.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Appearance and comments:</strong> Via Style controls curved or angled bends; Link Width controls arrow thickness. IN Comment and OUT Comment add text along each direction. The percentage sets the text position along the link. Comment Style places comments beside the link (Edge) or over the arrow (Centre); Use map default follows Map Style.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Additional hover graphs:</strong> Show a maximum of two hover graphs: the main traffic graph and one extra, such as CPU, latency or another interface. Filter by graph type narrows the choices. Add hover graph adds the extra; Replace hover graphs changes it; Remove graph removes it. The main traffic graph, measured traffic and link click destination stay unchanged. In the viewer, each Cacti preview opens its own full graph when clicked.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced settings:</strong> Optional controls for moving the IN/OUT traffic labels, combining measured sources, changing the click destination and entering custom hover image URLs. Traffic label positions move the utilisation boxes along the link, independently of comment positions. Use map default follows Map Style. A normal traffic link usually needs no changes here.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Combining traffic sources:</strong> Add traffic source adds another interface to the map total, separately for IN and OUT. Remove source removes an additional source. Change the primary source using Use interface at the top. The combined traffic is compared with the configured bandwidth to calculate utilisation. No combined Cacti graph is created automatically; create a matching aggregate graph in Cacti and enter its click and hover URLs if needed. Separate map links are usually clearer for primary and backup connections.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Manual sources and URLs:</strong> The source text box edits the complete measured-source list, including the primary source. Click destination URL controls where clicking the map link goes. Main hover graph URL sets the first preview; Additional graph URL(s) accepts one extra image URL. This extra is also managed under Additional hover graphs.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tidy and Via:</strong> Tidy adjusts the link layout. Via lets you place a bend point on the map.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Edit Raw Configuration:</strong> Edit the underlying map syntax for settings beyond this form.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Bandwit:</strong> Tọọ ikike mbufe a na-eji agbakọ ojiji, dịka ọmụmaatụ 100M ma ọ bụ 1G. A na-akwado K, M, G na T. Họrọ Otu ihe ahụ dị ka &quot;In&quot; mgbe ntụziaka abụọ ahụ nwere otu ikike mbufe.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ọdụ njikọ okporo data:</strong> Chọọ site na ngwaọrụ, port ma ọ bụ nkọwa, ma ọ bụ họrọ Chọgharịa niile. Họrọ ọdụ njikọ, wee pịa Jiri ọdụ njikọ iji tọọ isi iyi a tụrụ nke mbụ, ebe mpị na eserese nlele n'elu isi. A na-edebe isi iyi a tụrụ mgbakwunye na eserese nlele n'elu.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ọdịdị na nkọwa:</strong> Ụdị Ebe Agafe na-achịkwa nkpọkọ gbagọrọ agbagọ ma ọ bụ nke nwere nkuku; Obosara Njikọ na-achịkwa ọkpụrụkpụ akụ. Nkọwa N'IME na Nkọwa PỤỌ na-etinye ederede n'akụkụ ntụziaka nke ọ bụla. Pasentị na-atọ ọnọdụ ederede n'akụkụ njikọ. Ụdị Nkọwa na-etinye nkọwa n'akụkụ njikọ (Ọnụ) ma ọ bụ n'elu akụ (Etiti); Jiri nke ndabere maapụ na-esoro Ụdị Maapụ.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Eserese nlele n'elu mgbakwunye:</strong> Gosi kacha eserese nlele n'elu abụọ: eserese okporo data isi na otu mgbakwunye, dị ka CPU, latency ma ọ bụ ọdụ njikọ ọzọ. Zaa site n'ụdị eserese na-ebelata nhọrọ. Tinye eserese nlele n'elu na-etinye nke mgbakwunye; Dochie eserese nlele n'elu na-agbanwe ya; Wepụ eserese na-ewepụ ya. Eserese okporo data isi, okporo data a tụrụ na ebe mpị njikọ anaghị agbanwe. Na ngwa nlele, nlele Cacti nke ọ bụla na-emepe eserese zuru ezu nke ya mgbe a pịrị ya.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ntọala dị elu:</strong> Njikwa nhọrọ maka ibugharị mkpado okporo data N'IME/PỤỌ, ijikọ isi iyi a tụrụ, ịgbanwe ebe mpị na itinye URL onyonyo nlele n'elu ahaziri. Ọnọdụ mkpado okporo data na-ebugharị igbe ojiji n'akụkụ njikọ, n'adabereghị n'ọnọdụ nkọwa. Jiri nke ndabere maapụ na-esoro Ụdị Maapụ. Njikọ okporo data nkịtị anaghị achọ mgbanwe ebe a.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ijikọ isi iyi okporo data:</strong> Tinye isi iyi okporo data na-etinye ọdụ njikọ ọzọ na ngụkọta maapụ, iche maka N'IME na PỤỌ. Wepụ isi iyi na-ewepụ isi iyi mgbakwunye. Gbanwee isi iyi mbụ site na iji Jiri ọdụ njikọ n'elu. A na-atụnyere okporo data ejikọtara na bandwit ahaziri iji gbakọọ ojiji. A naghị emepụta eserese Cacti ejikọtara n'akpaaka; mepụta eserese mkpokọta dabara na Cacti ma tinye URL mpị na nlele n'elu ya ma ọ bụrụ na achọrọ. Njikọ maapụ dị iche na-adịkarị mfe nghọta maka njikọ isi na nke nkwado.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Isi iyi na URL aka:</strong> Igbe ederede isi iyi na-edezi ndepụta isi iyi a tụrụ zuru ezu, gụnyere isi iyi mbụ. URL ebe mpị na-achịkwa ebe ịpị njikọ maapụ na-aga. URL eserese nlele n'elu isi na-atọ nlele mbụ; URL eserese mgbakwunye na-anabata otu URL onyonyo mgbakwunye. A na-ejikwakwa mgbakwunye a n'okpuru Eserese nlele n'elu mgbakwunye.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Hazie nke ọma na Ebe Agafe:</strong> Hazie nke ọma na-edozi nhazi njikọ. Ebe Agafe na-enye gị ohere itinye ebe nkpọkọ na maapụ.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Dezie Nhazi Nkịtị:</strong> Dezie usoro maapụ dị n'okpuru maka ntọala karịrị fọm a.</p>"

